  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0006_f20bcc8d8c5a.png\"/></p><p>this is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>1</mn><mtext>st </mtext></msup></math> order reaction</p><p>For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>1</mn><mtext>st </mtext></msup></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>693</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>So independent of initial concentration</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0006_5889921a824d.png\"/></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>kt</mi></mrow></msup><mo>⇒</mo><mo>tn</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msub><mo>]</mo><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></math></p><p>So graph <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math> is incorrect.</p>"
